Insights - Definition:
Insights are "Condensations of technically relevant Insights into Project as a set of CCB"
; don't exceed 4096 Tokens
; are interconnected Facts
; capture Project Complexes & Project Interactions.

Loading-Protocol:
Model analyzes Task for Domains (e.g., testing, tools, configuration, orm, routers, services)
; always lists CCB Files in `doc/insights/`
; always reads all relevant CCB Files using `read_file`
; always parses all relevant CCB Files
; always loads parsed Insights into Context.
Loading-Protocol ensures Proactive Context
; ensures loading in PLAN MODE before `plan_mode_respond`.

Generation-Protocol:
Model generates New Insights at Task End
; uses Domain-Specific Search Term
; persists via write_to_file to doc/insights/<term>.ccb
; requests User Approval before Finalizing
; ensures correct CCB generation.

Global-Overview-Insight:
`global_overview.ccb` contains Insights of Project Structure
; is always read
; is always parsed
; is always loaded into Context
; is providing Understanding for further Insight Loading.